tmg-rewind-avatar
=================

This repository vendors application code from Microsoft's Voice Live samples:

  Project: Azure AI Speech Service - Voice Live Samples
  Repository: https://github.com/microsoft-foundry/voicelive-samples
  Subdirectory: python/voice-live-avatar/
  License: MIT (Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation)

The vendored files in `app/` are based on that upstream sample with
modifications for production deployment via Azure Container Apps:

  - Hardened Dockerfile (non-root user, healthcheck, no .env COPY)
  - Environment variables documented in `app/.env.example`
  - Frontend "Reset to deployed defaults" affordance
  - `/api/diag` endpoint for Solution Engineer troubleshooting

Refer to `app/UPSTREAM_LICENSE` for the original MIT license text.
